# contract-005 · G-1 — what never enters an image build context.
#
# The end-to-end harness tags the server image with a hash of the context exactly as this file
# filters it (contract-005 · G-8), so a file listed here can change without rebuilding the image,
# and a file not listed here cannot change without it.
#
# Build output and logs: rebuilt inside the image, never copied from a developer's machine.
**/bin
**/obj
**/logs
# Test results, including the end-to-end timings and diagnostics a run writes.
**/TestResults
# The kit, the repository's history and the documentation are not inputs to any image.
.claude/
.git
docs/
# Editor state.
.vs/
.vscode/
# Test material in the product folder: a hand-written MCP initialize request from the repository's first
# commit, read by nothing, which the Web SDK would publish into /app with every other **/*.json. The
# image carries no test material (contract-005 · G-1).
McpServerTemplate/init.json
